# Local build/release index. S3 is the durable, shareable source of truth --
# this folder is a local index plus instant-access template/param snapshots for
# rollback, and is rebuilt from S3 on demand.
#
# It also holds cfn-params.json snapshots, which carry real CRM / ai-calling
# secret values -- another reason this never gets committed.
deploy-versions/
config-versions/
